SUMMARY:MY HOUSE Junction Jazz Festival 2026
DESCRIPTION:Step into the past. Stay for the magic. \nThe 2nd Annual MY HOUSE Junction Jazz Festival returns to 2882 Dundas Street West\, bringing seven nights of extraordinary live jazz to one of Toronto’s most beloved neighbourhood venues. \nPresented in partnership with Brooklyn\, NY’s Browntasaurus Records — who maintains a studio right in the Junction — and proudly supported by Dufferin Gate Studios\, this year’s festival is led by internationally acclaimed Artist-In-Residence and Artistic Director BROWNMAN ALI: a 10× Global Music Award winner\, 12× JUNO Award nominee\, and GRAMMY Award long-lister who has hand-picked every act on the bill and will perform on stage every single night of the festival. \nThe 2026 program spans the full spectrum of jazz: \n– **Mon\, Jun 22 | 7PM** — Jordana Talsky: Live Looping *(Vocal Jazz)* \n– **Tue\, Jun 23 | 7PM** — Jacob Wutzke Trio *(Classic Jazz)* \n– **Wed\, Jun 24 | 7PM** — Nick MacLean 4-Tet play Herbie Hancock *(Modern Jazz)* \n– **Thu\, Jun 25 | 7PM** — Arecibo — Proyecto Blanquito *(Latin-Jazz)* \n– **Fri\, Jun 26 | 8PM** — Brownman Electryc Trio *(Electric-Jazz)* \n– **Sat\, Jun 27 | 8PM** — Genevieve Marentette’s Flux-State *(Vocal-Driving Electric-Jazz)* \n– **Sun\, Jun 28 | 4PM** — Miles Davis: The Prestige Years feat. Brownman Ali *(Classic Jazz — Matinée)* \nTickets range from $15–$35 advance. MY HOUSE is an intimate\, antique-furnished lounge and event venue rated in the top 5% of Toronto event spaces — reservations are strongly recommended to guarantee your seat. \nA distinctly Junction experience. Seven nights. Zero filler.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/my-house-junction-jazz-festival-2026/
LOCATION:My House\, 2882 Dundas Street West\, Toronto\, M6P 1Y8
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Festivals,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/my-house-junction-jazz-festival-2026.png
END:VEVENT
