SUMMARY:Croatia House TO2026 Kick-Off Bash & Opening Night
DESCRIPTION:Toronto\, get ready. \nOn Monday\, June 22\, 2026\, the Croatian community and football fans from around the world will gather for an unforgettable opening celebration as Croatia House TO2026 officially kicks off in Toronto. \nHosted at the Toronto Event Centre\, this high-energy evening marks an incredible two days of celebrations surrounding the highly anticipated Croatia vs Panama match in Toronto. \nCroatia House Kick-Off Bash & Opening Night promises an electric atmosphere! \nA chance to welcome Croatian supporters and friends from around the world. \nWhether you are travelling to Toronto or cheering from home\, this is where the Croatian spirit comes alive. \nEvent Details \nMonday\, June 22\, 20268:00 PM – 2:00 AM \nToronto Event Centre15 Saskatchewan Road\, Exhibition Place\, Toronto \nTickets: $2519+ Event \nGather your friends\, wear your red and white\, and be part of an unforgettable opening night filled with energy and music. \nOne city. One nation. Thousands of fans. \nPURCHASE TICKETS HERE – https://www.ticketweb.ca/venue/toronto-event-centre-toronto-on/496985
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/croatia-house-to2026-kick-off-bash-opening-night/
LOCATION:Toronto Event Centre\, Toronto Event Centre\, 15 Saskatchewan Road\, M6K 3C3 Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada\, Toronto
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Cultural Celebrations,Nightlife,Toronto26 (Soccer Celebration)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/croatia-house-to2026-kick-off-bash-opening-night.png
END:VEVENT
